                            <!-- Blog Content -->
                            <div class="ExternalClass7CB0B4C74BFF402C9B9344ABB63C0B6B"><p>​<span style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;">Yeni düzenleme ile;</span><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od" style="display&#58;inline-flex;vertical-align&#58;middle;padding-bottom&#58;0px;width&#58;16px;margin-bottom&#58;0px;margin-top&#58;0px;padding-top&#58;0px;height&#58;16px;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color&#58;#080809;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><img width="16" class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" alt="➡️" src="https&#58;//static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/27a1.png" height="16" style="border-width&#58;0px;border-style&#58;initial;margin&#58;5px;" /></span><span style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;">Vergi ve SGK borcu bulunmayan üreticiler için belge süresi 15 gün olarak belirlenmiştir.</span><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od" style="display&#58;inline-flex;vertical-align&#58;middle;padding-bottom&#58;0px;width&#58;16px;margin-bottom&#58;0px;margin-top&#58;0px;padding-top&#58;0px;height&#58;16px;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color&#58;#080809;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><img width="16" class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" alt="➡️" src="https&#58;//static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/27a1.png" height="16" style="border-width&#58;0px;border-style&#58;initial;margin&#58;5px;" /></span><span style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;">Borcu bulunan üreticilerde ise kredi tutarının azami %25’i borçlara mahsup edilerek kalan kısmın üreticiye kullandırılması imkânı getirilmiştir.</span><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od" style="display&#58;inline-flex;vertical-align&#58;middle;padding-bottom&#58;0px;width&#58;16px;margin-bottom&#58;0px;margin-top&#58;0px;padding-top&#58;0px;height&#58;16px;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color&#58;#080809;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><img width="16" class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" alt="➡️" src="https&#58;//static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/27a1.png" height="16" style="border-width&#58;0px;border-style&#58;initial;margin&#58;5px;" /></span><span style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;">Mahsup edilecek tutar yıllık toplam 300.000 TL ile sınırlandırılmıştır.</span><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><span class="html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od" style="display&#58;inline-flex;vertical-align&#58;middle;padding-bottom&#58;0px;width&#58;16px;margin-bottom&#58;0px;margin-top&#58;0px;padding-top&#58;0px;height&#58;16px;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;color&#58;#080809;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><img width="16" class="xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw" alt="➡️" src="https&#58;//static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/27a1.png" height="16" style="border-width&#58;0px;border-style&#58;initial;margin&#58;5px;" /></span><span style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;">Temel bitkisel ve hayvansal üretim faaliyetlerinde 400.000 TL’ye kadar aynî kredilerde 31.12.2026 tarihine kadar borcu yoktur şartı aranmayacaktır.</span><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><span style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;">Bu düzenleme ile üreticilerimizin finansmana erişiminin kolaylaştırılması ve üretim sürekliliğinin sağlanması hedeflenmektedir.</span><br class="html-br" style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;"><span style="color&#58;#080809;font-family&#58;&quot;segoe ui historic&quot;, &quot;segoe ui&quot;, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size&#58;15px;background-color&#58;#ffffff;">Üreticilerimize hayırlı olsun</span><br></p></div>
